1. DEFINITIONS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
- "Software" means the source code, object code, documentation, and associated
  media for the OmniMux platform, execution hub, and official product plugins.
- "Commercial Use" means using the Software for any revenue-generating activities
  that involve:
  (a) Selling, sublicensing, leasing, renting, or charging fees for the Software
      itself or any derivative works thereof;
  (b) Providing the functionality of the Software as a hosted service, managed
      service, Cloud SaaS, or paid workflow execution platform to third parties;
  (c) Embedding or bundling the Software into a proprietary commercial product
      distributed to external customers for a fee.
- "Internal Business Operations" means self-hosting and using the Software within
  your own organization or enterprise solely for automating your own internal
  workflows, social media accounts, or content operations, without charging
  external third parties for access to the Software functionality.
- "Personal Use" means non-commercial usage by an individual developer, hobbyist,
